1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,160
You don't even allow yourself to sit down and think, “Okay, can I rest now?”

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:11,760
“Can I take a day off without feeling guilty about it?”

3
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,560
Or do you think you should be producing more or earning more?

4
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:18,960
Do I understand that I have the right to enjoy myself and spend money on myself?

5
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:23,640
That I can spend a day simply chatting with someone who matters to me?

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,400
You don't have to be productive all the time.
